       from the Excursion data in excursions.html.twig and
       detail.html.twig's excursionData — ids are not shared across
       the two, and links below use type: 'circuit'.
       To edit a circuit: change the values below.
       To add one: copy a whole { ... } block, append it, and give
       it the next unused id (also add it to detail.html.twig's
       circuitData so its detail page works).
       ============================================================ #}
